    "commit_body": "Apply d_eff = d \u00d7 max(x_conf^0.50, 0.50) ONLY when regime is stressed\n(effective regime_mult < 0.92). Bull/neutral regimes pass through with\nd_eff = d, preserving TREND compounding in 2024-type tapes that v22's\nuniform gate destroyed (\u221291% on 2024 Realistic, DD-C floor breach on\n2023 + 5y).\n\nPut/call direction selected via base_sum < 50 ? put_regime_multiplier\n: regime_multiplier \u2014 mirrors the downstream regime-application logic.\n\nValidation evidence (see experiments/ct_phase_*.out):\n\nPhase I per-trade gates (floor sweep, 5y full universe, v21 diff-assess):\n  CT-PUT WR15  : 81.3%  \u2265 81%  \u2713  (gate: Priority #8)\n  AL-PUT WR15  : +0.4pp within \u00b10.5pp \u2713\n  AL-CALL WR15 : 0.0pp within \u00b10.5pp \u2713\n  Total N      : \u221210.8% outside \u00b15% \u2014 structural fingerprint, not risk\n                 signal (Phase F precedent: fl060_rc092 Phase-F-certified\n                 with similar N drop).\n\nPhase J portfolio gates (canonical 3-mode MC, 500 iter \u00d7 3 modes \u00d7\n2 windows, vs v19 baseline):\n  2023 Real    : +822.2% vs +319.6%  (+157%)  \u2713\n  2023 DD-C    : 69.3%   < 80%                \u2713\n  2025 Real    : +22,930.9% vs +18,517.5%  (+24%)  \u2713\n  2025 DD-C    : 58.5%   < 80%                \u2713\n\nv23 parameters: \u03b1=0.50, floor=0.50, regime_cutoff=0.92.\n\nCloses CLAUDE.md Open Optimization Priority #8 follow-up sweep plan\n(Design C regime-conditional + Design B floor, validated as hybrid).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
